===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

#{{law}} a physical or photographic queue of people allegedly involved in a crime
#{{Canadian English}} A line of people or vehicles, in which the individual at the front end is dealt with first, the one behind is dealt with next, and so on, and in which newcomers join at the end.

